atic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294780/extras/e324f8d8f86cf18f1af3e661250d5bf3.webm?t=1750147435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294780/extras/e324f8d8f86cf18f1af3e661250d5bf3.mp4?t=1750147435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Unlock new <strong>characters, weapons, playmodes</strong> and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294780/extras/2afe4fe4b1f6715a40b3e57d441405b1.avif?t=1750147435\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Discord to discuss builds, report bugs and give us feedback !</p>",
